<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Accumed started as buy.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Accumed started as buy.</headline>
<text>
<p>--Vector Securities International analyst Benjamin Andrew said he started coverage of Accumed International Inc with a buy rating.</p>
<p>--Shares in the microbiology specialties concern were off 3/8 to 4.</p>
<p>--&quot;ACMI offers a unique solution to the issues facing labs that perform pap smears,&quot; Andrew said.</p>
<p>--Chicago Newsdesk 312-408-8787</p>
</text>
